    <h2 id="ownership-title">Each system owns a different part of the work.</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">These boundaries come from the linked project documentation. Cross-project references leave each system's ownership intact; integration is claimed only when the source documents it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ownership-table-wrap">
