        <tr><th scope="row"><a href="https://github.com/ForgeWireLabs/repopact-core">RepoPact Core</a><span class="status status--released">Released CLI · 3.1.3</span></th><td>Repository governance semantics, validation, schemas, and typed operations.</td><td>Derived views do not overrule checked-in records; release conformance is version-scoped.</td></tr>
