      <p class="eyebrow">Evidence and scope</p>
      <h2>Say what was observed, and where.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-copy">
      <p>A package release, source build, platform acceptance record, and private development snapshot are different kinds of evidence. The project pages preserve those distinctions and link to the repositories that define them.</p>
      <p>For RepoPact, local verification and hosted publication are separate operations. Workbench has recorded local platform checks and remains a source-build preview. ForgeWire and Fabric remain private development; the public site links only to overview materials.</p>
